Package: MSstatsWeightedSummary
Type: Package
Title: Weighted Protein-Level Summarization for Cluster of Proteins with Shared Peptides
Version: 0.102.7
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mateusz", "Staniak", email = "mtst@mstaniak.pl", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ting", "Huang", email = "thuang0703@gmail.com", role = "ctb"),
    person("Małgorzata", "Bogdan", email = "malgorzata.bogdan@uwr.edu.pl", role = "aut"),
    person("Olga", "Vitek", email = "o.vitek@northeastern.edu", role = "aut"))
Description: Protein-level summarization of feature (PSM)-level data is an important step
    in proteomics data analysis methods, including the MSstats workflow. MSstats and MSstatsTMT
    packages summarize features based on unique peptides. This package implements 
    a statistical method to jointly summarize clusters of proteins that share features 
    using weights specific to peptide-protein matches.
